@title 3D Heat: Heat flow lines have their own Lines (number) and Intensity sliders
@area 3D
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# Tadjiro: airflow streamlines let you choose how many and how strong, heat flow lines had one setting. With Heat flow set to Carried by air, the strip now shows Lines and Intensity sliders of their own. Pictures are the evidence.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-cooling-advice.novo
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 30
click_text Heat #1
wait 20
click_text Cancel
wait 10
click_text Auto #1
wait 10
try click_text Cancel
wait 10
click_text "Settings for the next run"
wait 10
click_text Quick
wait 10
click_text Simulate #2
wait_s 200
expect_not "Preliminary"
click_text Off #2
wait 10
click_text "Carried by air"
wait 30
shot default
expect "Intensity"
expect "Lines"
check_layout
